Harvested test data (ADR-0005)
-----------------------------

This product includes test *data* copied verbatim from the Cilium project at
commit 7d68cfb394 (tag v1.20.1), under the Apache License 2.0. No Cilium test
code was copied; every harness is an independent Rust implementation.

  tests/scripttest/corpus/**   168 .txtar scenario files and their embedded
                               fixtures, from 29 testdata directories under
                               pkg/, operator/, clustermesh-apiserver/ and
                               contrib/. Each area directory carries a
                               PROVENANCE file naming its exact upstream path,
                               the commit, the license and the copy date.

  tests/golden/**              1,196 data fixtures from 12 testdata/golden/
                               fixtures directories: Gateway API and Ingress
                               golden YAML (operator/pkg/gateway-api,
                               operator/pkg/model/{ingestion,translation}),
                               Hubble metrics and flow-log config YAML,
                               cilium-health .golden CLI output, captured
                               CiliumNode/Service objects, an Envoy config-dump
                               redaction pair, a /proc/net/xfrm_stat capture,
                               load-balancer benchmark seeds, and the
                               control-plane suite's k8s object sets from
                               test/controlplane. Each area directory carries a
                               PROVENANCE file naming its exact upstream path,
                               the commit, the license, the copy date and any
                               modification. One file is modified: the four EC
                               private-key PEM blobs in the Envoy config-dump
                               input were replaced with a placeholder so no key
                               material is redistributed.

  tests/fuzz/corpus/**         30 fuzz seed files from
                               pkg/policy/testdata/fuzz/FuzzDistillPolicy (27)
                               and pkg/container/bitlpm/testdata/fuzz/FuzzUint8
                               (3), in Go's "go test fuzz v1" corpus format.
                               PROVENANCE in tests/fuzz/corpus/.

  tests/bpf/**                 BPF test-case inventory (CASES.toml, 142 files /
                               625 cases) derived from cilium/cilium bpf/tests
                               at commit 7d68cfb394. That directory is licensed
                               GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause; flowsdn elects
                               **BSD-2-Clause**. Only case names, section kinds,
                               packet shapes, feature gates and assertions were
                               derived; no C source was copied. Full election
                               statement, the BSD-2-Clause text and a
                               taken/not-taken inventory are in
                               tests/bpf/PROVENANCE.

